WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.146
Hi! A big, black dog. Big and black are adjectives. Today we'll learn adjectives and their opposites.

2
00:00:10.296 --> 00:00:13.914
Adjectives tell us what a person or thing is like.

3
00:00:14.064 --> 00:00:20.586
They can tell colour, size, shape and feelings: red, tiny, round, happy.

4
00:00:20.736 --> 00:00:24.738
An adjective goes before the noun: a big dog.

5
00:00:24.888 --> 00:00:29.706
It can also come after is: the dog is big.

6
00:00:29.856 --> 00:00:34.290
Opposites mean the reverse: big and small, tall and short.

7
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:37.338
Hot and cold, fast and slow.

8
00:00:37.488 --> 00:00:40.626
Happy and sad, full and empty.

9
00:00:40.776 --> 00:00:46.482
When a sentence has but, the two parts often have opposite meanings.

10
00:00:46.632 --> 00:00:50.658
Watch out! The opposite of long is not tall!

11
00:00:50.808 --> 00:00:53.274
Long's opposite is short.

12
00:00:53.424 --> 00:00:57.306
Tall's opposite is short too.

13
00:00:57.456 --> 00:01:05.322
Your turn! What is the opposite of hot? Pause and think.

14
00:01:05.472 --> 00:01:10.746
The opposite of hot is cold. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:10.896 --> 00:01:20.058
Another one! An elephant is, ___. Which one? Pause and think.

16
00:01:20.208 --> 00:01:26.154
An elephant is very big: huge. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:26.304 --> 00:01:36.738
Here's another! The glass is, ___. There is no water. Which one? Pause and think.

18
00:01:36.888 --> 00:01:41.946
No water means empty. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:42.096 --> 00:01:52.170
Try one more! A tortoise is slow but a rabbit is, ___. Which one? Pause and think.

20
00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:57.906
But shows opposites, so fast. Did you get it right?

21
00:01:58.056 --> 00:02:08.250
Try one more! Mei got a gift. She is, ___. Which one? Pause and think.

22
00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:13.794
Getting a gift makes her happy. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:13.944 --> 00:02:22.002
Try one more! What is the opposite of tall? Pause and think.

24
00:02:22.152 --> 00:02:27.426
The opposite of tall is short. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:27.576 --> 00:02:37.410
Try one more! I have a, ___, ball. Which one is an adjective? Pause and think.

26
00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:43.362
Red is a colour, so it's an adjective. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:43.512 --> 00:02:51.378
Last one! What is the opposite of full? Pause and think.

28
00:02:51.528 --> 00:02:56.921
The opposite of full is empty. Did you get it right?

29
00:02:57.071 --> 00:03:04.865
Remember: adjectives describe people and things, before a noun or after is. Opposites mean the reverse.

30
00:03:05.016 --> 00:03:09.641
Describe your school bag with three adjectives!

